word-predict: third-party notice
================================

1. Origin
---------

The code under word-predict/engine/, the file word-predict/provider.ts and the
data file word-predict/data/web-prior.bin.zst are ported or copied from
oh-my-pi (https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi, commit 67ef5342de):

  - crates/pi-predict           the N-gram word-completion engine (Rust), ported
                                to TypeScript under word-predict/engine/, and
                                data/web-prior.bin.zst, copied byte for byte
  - packages/tui/src/prompt     the word-completion provider and prose gates,
                                ported as word-predict/provider.ts

