3. Data provenance of web-prior.bin.zst
---------------------------------------

As stated in oh-my-pi's crates/pi-predict/scripts/build-web-prior.ts, which
builds the file:

  - unigram and bigram counts come from Peter Norvig's count_1w.txt and
    count_2w.txt (https://norvig.com/ngrams/), which are derived from the
    Google Web Trillion Word Corpus;
  - dictionary membership ("trusted" spelling) comes from the system word list
    /usr/share/dict/words.
